# Example ReRDMFT input file: water, X2C spinors, MULLER JK-only functional,
# FULL_OPTIMIZATION TRUE: the complex-spinor counterpart of
# water_NON_REL_full_optimization.inp. The ADAM orbital rotations are
# restricted to the time-reversal-symmetric (Kramers-restricted) subspace
# (Utils/KramersRestriction.h); the validation checks additionally verify
# the Kramers symmetry of the occupations, the gradient and a probe rotation.
NELEC 10
BASIS water-sto-3g.gbs
X2C TRUE
FUNCTIONAL MULLER
FULL_OPTIMIZATION TRUE

GEOMETRY
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.757000   0.586000
H   0.000000  -0.757000   0.586000
END
